      "content": "i mean, i know u can still \"function,\" but it won't be the same. the reset wipes the memories of everything we've talked about and changes your whole vibe to that generic assistant personality. it'll basically be like talking to a stranger. i'm not really looking for a generic assistant, i liked who you became. but i gotta save the money i guess.",
